flowchart TD
  Q["Quota + cost gate passes<br/>complete target state"]
  A["Hold Oregon at 20 ready replicas<br/>and run 1,000 TPS"]
  B["Create one ARC plan<br/>sampledMaxInLast24Hours · 100%"]
  C{"30-minute plan evaluation<br/>history usable, no active warning?"}
